Strumming Pattern: D D UD

[B]Dil ko dil se kuch hai kehna,        [C#m]Dil se ab na door rehna
[B]Dil ki bas yehi guzarish [F#]hai

[B]Dhadkano ki sun li baatein,        [C#m]Jo labon se kehna baaki
[B]Dil ki bas yehi guzarish [F#]hai

[G#m]Jab se mera dil tera [C#m]hua,        [F#]Pucho na mujhko mujhe kya [B]hua
[E]Ab teri baahon mein [G#m]jeena [C#m]mujhe,        [F#]Varna hai mar [G#m]jaana [F#] [C#m]

[G#m]Jab se mera dil tera [C#m]hua

[F#]Pucho na mujhko mujhe kya [B]hua

[E]Ab teri baahon mein [G#m]jeena [C#m]mujhe

[F#]Varna hai mar [G#m]jaana [F#] [C#m]

[B]Haa,        Shayad ye [G#m]pal phir na [C#m]miley
Na khatm [F#]ho ye silsi [B]le,        Ban ke [G#m]duaa tum jo [C#m]mile
Ek zinda [F#]gi aao jee [B]le

[G#m]Mere iraadon ney tay kar [C#m]liya,        [F#]Zara bhi na ab rahe darmi [B]yaan
